    "sections": {
        "description": "Wens Corporate is a modern and professional child theme designed for corporate and business websites, built on the robust Wens Haelo theme. It utilizes the latest WordPress Full Site Editing (FSE) capabilities, allowing users to easily customize every aspect of their website, from headers and footers to templates and global styles, without requiring any coding skills. This theme comes with specially designed templates for portfolio and blog content types, making it an excellent choice for agencies, startups, freelancers, and companies looking to showcase their work and share updates. Wens Corporate retains the clean design and flexible layout system of its parent theme, Wens Haelo, while offering a streamlined style that is optimized for performance, responsiveness, and SEO. As a fully FSE-compatible theme, it includes native translation-ready files and features a lightweight structure, enabling users to create elegant, fast, and highly customizable websites that look great on any device."
    },
